#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:2
msgid "Read the Docs tutorial"
msgstr "Read the Docs 教程"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:4
msgid ""
"In this tutorial you will learn how to host a public documentation project "
"on Read the Docs Community."
msgstr "在本教程中，你将学习如何在 Read the Docs Community 上托管一个公开文档项目。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:8
msgid ""
"Find out the `differences between Read the Docs Community and Read the Docs "
"Business <https://about.readthedocs.com/pricing/#/community>`_."
msgstr ""
"了解 `Read the Docs Community 与 Read the Docs Business 的区别 "
"<https://about.readthedocs.com/pricing/#/community>`_。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:10
msgid "In the tutorial we will:"
msgstr "在本教程中，我们将："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:12
msgid ""
"Import a Sphinx project from a GitHub repository (no prior experience with "
"Sphinx is required)."
msgstr "从 GitHub 仓库导入一个 Sphinx 项目（无需 Sphinx 使用经验）。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:13
msgid "Tailor the project's configuration."
msgstr "定制项目的配置。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:14
msgid "Explore other useful Read the Docs features."
msgstr "探索 Read the Docs 的其他实用功能。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:16
msgid ""
"If you don't have a GitHub account, you'll need to `register for a free "
"account <https://github.com/signup>`_ before you start."
msgstr "如果你还没有 GitHub 账户，需要在开始之前 `注册一个免费账户 <https://github.com/signup>`_。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:19
msgid "Preparing your repository on GitHub"
msgstr "在 GitHub 上准备你的仓库"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:21
msgid ""
"`Sign in to GitHub <https://github.com/login>`_ and navigate to the "
"`tutorial GitHub template <https://github.com/readthedocs/tutorial-"
"template/>`_."
msgstr ""
"`登录 GitHub <https://github.com/login>`_，然后前往 `教程 GitHub 模板 "
"<https://github.com/readthedocs/tutorial-template/>`_。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:23
msgid ""
"Click the green :guilabel:`Use this template` button, then click "
":guilabel:`Create a new Repository`. On the new page:"
msgstr ""
"点击绿色的 :guilabel:`Use this template` 按钮，然后点击 :guilabel:`Create a new "
"Repository`。在新页面上："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:25
msgid "Owner"
msgstr "所有者"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:26
msgid "Leave the default, or change it to something suitable for a tutorial project."
msgstr "保留默认值，或将其更改为适合教程项目的名称。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:27
msgid "Repository name"
msgstr "仓库名称"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:28
msgid "Something memorable and appropriate, for example ``rtd-tutorial``."
msgstr "一个易于记忆且合适的名称，例如 ``rtd-tutorial``。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:29
msgid "Visibility"
msgstr "可见性"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:30
msgid "Make sure the project is \"Public\", rather than \"Private\"."
msgstr "确保项目是\"Public\"（公开）而非\"Private\"（私有）。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:32
msgid ""
"Click the green :guilabel:`Create repository` button to create a public "
"repository that you will use in this Read the Docs tutorial, containing  "
"following files:"
msgstr "点击绿色的 :guilabel:`Create repository` 按钮，创建一个公有仓库用于本 Read the Docs 教程，其中包含以下文件："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:34
msgid "``.readthedocs.yaml``"
msgstr "``.readthedocs.yaml``"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:35
msgid "Read the Docs configuration file. Required."
msgstr "Read the Docs 配置文件。必需。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:37
msgid "``README.rst``"
msgstr "``README.rst``"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:38
msgid "Description of the repository."
msgstr "仓库说明。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:40
msgid "``pyproject.toml``"
msgstr "``pyproject.toml``"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:41
msgid ""
"Python project metadata that makes it installable. Useful for automatic "
"documentation generation from sources."
msgstr "使项目可安装的 Python 项目元数据。有助于从源代码自动生成文档。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:44
msgid "``lumache.py``"
msgstr "``lumache.py``"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:45
msgid "Source code of the fictional Python library."
msgstr "这个虚构 Python 库的源代码。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:47
msgid "``docs/``"
msgstr "``docs/``"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:48
msgid ""
"Directory holding all the fictional Python library documentation in "
"reStructuredText, the Sphinx configuration ``docs/source/conf.py`` and the "
"root document ``docs/source/index.rst``."
msgstr ""
"该目录包含这个虚构 Python 库的全部 reStructuredText 文档、Sphinx 配置 ``docs/source/conf.py`` "
"以及根文档 ``docs/source/index.rst``。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:51
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:56
msgid "GitHub template for the tutorial"
msgstr "教程的 GitHub 模板"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:59
msgid "Creating a Read the Docs account"
msgstr "创建 Read the Docs 账户"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:61
msgid ""
"To create a Read the Docs account: navigate to the `Sign Up page "
"<https://app.readthedocs.org/accounts/signup/>`_ and choose the option "
":guilabel:`Sign up with GitHub`. On the authorization page, click the green "
":guilabel:`Authorize readthedocs` button."
msgstr ""
"要创建 Read the Docs 账户，请前往 `注册页面 "
"<https://app.readthedocs.org/accounts/signup/>`_ 并选择 :guilabel:`Sign up with"
" GitHub` 选项。在授权页面上，点击绿色的 :guilabel:`Authorize readthedocs` 按钮。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:66
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:71
msgid "GitHub authorization page"
msgstr "GitHub 授权页面"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:75
msgid ""
"Read the Docs needs elevated permissions to perform certain operations that "
"ensure that the workflow is as smooth as possible, like installing "
":term:`webhooks <webhook>`. If you want to learn more, check out "
":ref:`reference/git-integration:permissions for connected accounts`."
msgstr ""
"Read the Docs 需要更高的权限来执行某些操作，以确保工作流程尽可能顺畅，例如安装 :term:`Webhook "
"<webhook>`。如需了解更多信息，请参阅 :ref:`reference/git-integration:permissions for "
"connected accounts`。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:81
msgid ""
"After that, you will be redirected to Read the Docs to confirm your e-mail "
"and username. Click the :guilabel:`Sign Up »` button to create your account "
"and open your :term:`dashboard`."
msgstr ""
"之后，你将被重定向到 Read the Docs 以确认邮箱和用户名。点击 :guilabel:`Sign Up »` 按钮创建账户并打开你的 "
":term:`dashboard`。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:84
msgid ""
"When you have clicked the link in your email from Read the Docs to \"verify "
"your email address\" and finalize the process, your Read the Docs account "
"will be ready to create your first project."
msgstr ""
"当你点击 Read the Docs 发来的邮件中用于\"验证邮箱地址\"的链接并完成整个流程后，你的 Read the Docs "
"账户就可以创建第一个项目了。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:86
msgid "Read the Docs empty dashboard"
msgstr "空的 Read the Docs 仪表盘"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:91
msgid "Welcome to your Read the Docs dashboard!"
msgstr "欢迎使用你的 Read the Docs 仪表盘！"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:94
msgid "Importing the project to Read the Docs"
msgstr "将项目导入 Read the Docs"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:96
msgid "To import your GitHub project to Read the Docs:"
msgstr "要将你的 GitHub 项目导入 Read the Docs："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:98
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`Import a Project` button on your `dashboard "
"<https://app.readthedocs.org/dashboard/>`_."
msgstr ""
"点击你的 `dashboard <https://app.readthedocs.org/dashboard/>`_ 上的 "
":guilabel:`Import a Project` 按钮。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:100
msgid ""
"Click the |:heavy_plus_sign:| button to the right of your ``rtd-tutorial`` "
"project. If the list of repositories is empty, click the "
"|:arrows_counterclockwise:| button."
msgstr ""
"点击 ``rtd-tutorial`` 项目右侧的 |:heavy_plus_sign:| 按钮。如果仓库列表为空，请点击 "
"|:arrows_counterclockwise:| 按钮。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:102
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:107
msgid "Import projects workflow"
msgstr "导入项目流程"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:109
msgid "Enter some details about your Read the Docs project:"
msgstr "输入你的 Read the Docs 项目的一些详细信息："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:111
msgid "Name"
msgstr "名称"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:112
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The name of the project, used to create a unique subdomain for each project."
" so it is better if you prepend your username, for example ``{username}-rtd-"
"tutorial``."
msgstr "项目名称，用于为每个项目创建唯一的子域名。因此最好在前面加上你的用户名，例如 ``{username}-rtd-tutorial``。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:116
msgid "Repository URL"
msgstr "仓库 URL"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:117
msgid ""
"The URL that contains the documentation source. Leave the automatically "
"filled value."
msgstr "包含文档源代码的 URL。保留自动填充的值即可。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:119
msgid "Default branch"
msgstr "默认分支"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:120
msgid "Name of the default branch of the project, leave it as ``main``."
msgstr "项目的默认分支名称，保留为 ``main``。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:122
msgid ""
"Then click the :guilabel:`Next` button to create the project and open the "
":term:`project home`."
msgstr "然后点击 :guilabel:`Next` 按钮创建项目并打开 :term:`project home`。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:124
msgid "You just created your first project on Read the Docs! |:tada:|"
msgstr "你刚刚在 Read the Docs 上创建了第一个项目！|:tada:|"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:126
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:131
msgid "Project home"
msgstr "项目主页"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:134
msgid "Checking the first build"
msgstr "检查首次构建"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:136
msgid ""
"Read the Docs will build your project documentation right after you create "
"it."
msgstr "项目创建后，Read the Docs 会立即构建你的项目文档。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:138
msgid "To see the build logs:"
msgstr "查看构建日志："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:140
msgid ""
"Click the :guilabel:`Your documentation is building` link on the "
":term:`project home`."
msgstr "点击 :term:`project home` 上的 :guilabel:`Your documentation is building` 链接。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:142
msgid ""
"If the build has not finished by the time you open it, you will see a "
"spinner next to a \"Installing\" or \"Building\" indicator, meaning that it "
"is still in progress."
msgstr "如果你打开时构建尚未完成，你会在\"Installing\"或\"Building\"指示器旁边看到一个旋转图标，表示构建仍在进行中。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:143
msgid ""
"If the build has finished, you'll see a green \"Build completed\" indicator,"
" the completion date, the elapsed time, and a link to the generated "
"documentation."
msgstr "如果构建已完成，你会看到绿色的\"Build completed\"指示器、完成日期、耗时以及指向生成文档的链接。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:145
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:150
msgid "First successful documentation build"
msgstr "首次成功构建文档"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:152
msgid "Click on :guilabel:`View docs` to see your documentation live!"
msgstr "点击 :guilabel:`View docs` 即可在线查看你的文档！"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:154
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:159
msgid "HTML documentation live on Read the Docs"
msgstr "在 Read the Docs 上发布的 HTML 文档"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:163
msgid ""
"Advertisement is one of our main sources of revenue. If you want to learn "
"more about how do we fund our operations and explore options to go ad-free, "
"check out our `Sustainability page "
"<https://app.readthedocs.org/sustainability/>`_."
msgstr ""
"广告是我们的主要收入来源之一。如果你想了解更多关于我们如何维持运营的信息，并探索去除广告的选项，请查看我们的 `Sustainability page "
"<https://app.readthedocs.org/sustainability/>`_。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:168
msgid ""
"If you don't see the ad, you might be using an ad blocker. Our EthicalAds "
"network respects your privacy, doesn't target you, and tries to be as "
"unobtrusive as possible, so we would like to kindly ask you to :doc:`not "
"block us </advertising/ad-blocking>` |:heart:|"
msgstr ""
"如果你没有看到广告，可能是使用了广告拦截器。我们的 EthicalAds 网络尊重你的隐私、不进行定向投放，并尽可能减少干扰，因此我们恳请你 "
":doc:`不要屏蔽我们 </advertising/ad-blocking>` |:heart:|"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:174
msgid "Configuring the project"
msgstr "配置项目"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:176
msgid "To update the project description and configure the notification settings:"
msgstr "要更新项目描述并配置通知设置："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:178
msgid ""
"Navigate back to the :term:`project page` and click the :guilabel:`⚙ Admin` "
"button,to open the Settings page."
msgstr "返回 :term:`project page`，点击 :guilabel:`⚙ Admin` 按钮，打开设置页面。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:180
msgid "Update the project description by adding the following text:"
msgstr "通过添加以下文本来更新项目描述："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:182
msgid ""
"Lumache (/lu'make/) is a Python library for cooks and food lovers that "
"creates recipes mixing random ingredients."
msgstr "Lumache（读作 /lu'make/）是一个面向厨师和美食爱好者的 Python 库，可通过混合随机食材来生成食谱。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:185
msgid ""
"Set the project homepage to ``https://world.openfoodfacts.org/``, and add "
"``food, python`` to the list of public project tags."
msgstr "将项目主页设置为 ``https://world.openfoodfacts.org/``，并在公开项目标签列表中添加 ``food, python``。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:187
msgid ""
"To get a notification if the build fails, click the :guilabel:`Email "
"Notifications` link on the left, add your email address, and click the "
":guilabel:`Add` button."
msgstr ""
"要在构建失败时收到通知，请点击左侧的 :guilabel:`Email Notifications` 链接，添加你的邮箱地址，然后点击 "
":guilabel:`Add` 按钮。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:190
msgid "Triggering builds from pull requests"
msgstr "从 Pull Request 触发构建"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:192
msgid ""
"Read the Docs can :doc:`trigger builds from GitHub pull requests </pull-"
"requests>` and show you a preview of the documentation with those changes."
msgstr ""
"Read the Docs 可以 :doc:`从 GitHub Pull Request 触发构建 </pull-"
"requests>`，并向你展示包含这些变更的文档预览。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:195
msgid ""
"This is enabled by default on new projects. You can check it from your "
"project under :guilabel:`Settings` → :guilabel:`Pull request builds`."
msgstr ""
"此功能在新项目中默认启用。你可以在项目的 :guilabel:`Settings` → :guilabel:`Pull request builds` "
"中查看。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:198
msgid "To see it in action:"
msgstr "要查看实际效果："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:200
msgid "Make some changes to your documentation:"
msgstr "对你的文档做一些修改："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:202
msgid ""
"Navigate to your GitHub repository, locating the file "
"``docs/source/index.rst``, and clicking on the |:pencil2:| icon on the top-"
"right with the tooltip \"Edit this file\" to open a web editor (more "
"information `on their documentation`__)."
msgstr ""
"前往你的 GitHub 仓库，找到 ``docs/source/index.rst`` 文件，点击右上角提示为\"Edit this file\"的 "
"|:pencil2:| 图标，打开网页编辑器（更多信息见 `on their documentation`__）。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:206
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:211
msgid "File view on GitHub before launching the editor"
msgstr "启动编辑器前的 GitHub 文件视图"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:213
msgid "In the editor, add the following sentence to the file:"
msgstr "在编辑器中，向文件添加以下句子："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:215
msgid "docs/source/index.rst"
msgstr "docs/source/index.rst"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:220
msgid ""
"Write an appropriate commit message, choose the \"Create a **new branch** "
"for this commit and start a pull request\" option."
msgstr ""
"填写合适的提交信息，选择\"Create a **new branch** for this commit and start a pull "
"request\"选项。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:222
msgid ""
"Click the green :guilabel:`Propose changes` button to open the new pull "
"request page, then click the :guilabel:`Create pull request` button below "
"the description."
msgstr ""
"点击绿色的 :guilabel:`Propose changes` 按钮打开新建 Pull Request 页面，然后点击描述下方的 "
":guilabel:`Create pull request` 按钮。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:224
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:229
msgid "Read the Docs building the pull request from GitHub"
msgstr "Read the Docs 正在构建来自 GitHub 的 Pull Request"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:231
msgid ""
"After opening the pull request, a Read the Docs check will appear indicating"
" that it is building the documentation for that pull request. If you click "
"the :guilabel:`Details` link while your project is building the build log "
"will be opened. After building this link opens the documentation directly."
msgstr ""
"打开 Pull Request 后，会出现一个 Read the Docs 检查项，表明它正在为该 Pull Request "
"构建文档。如果在项目构建时点击 :guilabel:`Details` 链接，将打开构建日志。构建完成后，该链接会直接打开文档。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:237
msgid "Adding a configuration file"
msgstr "添加配置文件"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:239
msgid ""
"The Admin tab of the :term:`project home` has some *global* configuration "
"settings for your project."
msgstr ":term:`project home` 的 Admin 选项卡中包含一些针对你项目的*全局*配置设置。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:241
msgid ""
"Build process configuration settings are in ``.readthedocs.yaml`` "
":doc:`configuration file </config-file/v2>`, in your Git repository, which "
"means it can be different for every version or branch of your project (more "
"on `versioning <#versioning-documentation>`_)."
msgstr ""
"构建过程的配置设置位于你 Git 仓库中的 ``.readthedocs.yaml`` :doc:`配置文件 </config-file/v2>` "
"中，这意味着项目的每个版本或分支都可以有不同的配置（详见 `版本管理 <#versioning-documentation>`_）。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:249
msgid "Using different Python versions"
msgstr "使用不同的 Python 版本"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:251
msgid ""
"To build your project with Python 3.8 instead of the latest Python version, "
"edit the ``.readthedocs.yaml`` file and change the Python version to 3.8 "
"like this:"
msgstr ""
"要使用 Python 3.8 而非最新的 Python 版本构建项目，请编辑 ``.readthedocs.yaml`` 文件，将 Python "
"版本改为 3.8，如下所示："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:253
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:326
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:359
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:384
msgid ".readthedocs.yaml"
msgstr ".readthedocs.yaml"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:271
msgid ""
"The :doc:`purpose of each key </config-file/v2>` in the "
"``.readthedocs.yaml`` configuration file is:"
msgstr "``.readthedocs.yaml`` 配置文件中:doc:`每个键的用途 </config-file/v2>` 如下："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:273
msgid "``version``"
msgstr "``version``"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:274
msgid ""
"Required, specifies :doc:`version 2 of the configuration file </config-"
"file/v2>`."
