"Required, specifies the Docker image used to build the documentation. "
":ref:`states the name of the base image <config-file/v2:build.os>`."
msgstr "必需，指定用于构建文档的 Docker 镜像。:ref:`声明基础镜像的名称 <config-file/v2:build.os>`。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:280
msgid "``build.tools.python``"
msgstr "``build.tools.python``"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:281
msgid "Specifies the :ref:`Python version <config-file/v2:build.tools.python>`."
msgstr "指定 :ref:`Python 版本 <config-file/v2:build.tools.python>`。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:283
msgid "``python.install.requirements``"
msgstr "``python.install.requirements``"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:284
msgid ""
"Specifies what :ref:`Python dependencies <config-file/v2:python.install>` to"
" install."
msgstr "指定要安装的 :ref:`Python 依赖 <config-file/v2:python.install>`。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:286
msgid ""
"After you commit these changes, go back to your project home, navigate to "
"the \"Builds\" page, and open the new build that just started. You will "
"notice that one of the lines contains ``python -mvirtualenv``: if you click "
"on it, you will see the full output of the corresponding command, stating "
"that it used Python 3.8.6, the latest version of Python 3.8, to create the "
"virtual environment."
msgstr ""
"提交这些更改后，返回项目主页，前往\"Builds\"页面，打开刚刚启动的新构建。你会注意到其中一行包含 ``python "
"-mvirtualenv``：点击它可查看该命令的完整输出，其中显示它使用 Python 3.8.6（Python 3.8 的最新版本）创建了虚拟环境。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:292
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:297
msgid "Read the Docs build using Python 3.8"
msgstr "使用 Python 3.8 的 Read the Docs 构建"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:300
msgid "Making build warnings more visible"
msgstr "让构建警告更醒目"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:302
msgid ""
"If you navigate to your HTML documentation, you will notice that the index "
"page looks correct but the API section is empty. This is a common issue with"
" Sphinx, and the reason is stated in the build logs. On the build page you "
"opened before, click on the :guilabel:`View raw` link on the top right, "
"which opens the build logs in plain text, and you will see several warnings:"
msgstr ""
"如果你查看 HTML 文档，会发现首页看起来正常，但 API 部分为空。这是 Sphinx "
"的常见问题，原因已在构建日志中说明。在之前打开的构建页面上，点击右上角的 :guilabel:`View raw` "
"链接，它会以纯文本形式打开构建日志，你将看到几条警告："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:321
msgid ""
"To spot these warnings more easily and help you to address them, add the "
"``sphinx.fail_on_warning`` option to your Read the Docs configuration file."
msgstr "为了更容易发现这些警告并帮助你解决它们，请在 Read the Docs 配置文件中添加 ``sphinx.fail_on_warning`` 选项。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:324
msgid ""
"To fail on warnings to your Read the Docs project, edit the "
"``.readthedocs.yaml`` file in your project, add the three lines of "
"``sphinx`` configuration below, and commit the file:"
msgstr ""
"要让 Read the Docs 项目在出现警告时构建失败，请编辑项目中的 ``.readthedocs.yaml`` 文件，添加下面三行 "
"``sphinx`` 配置，然后提交该文件："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:345
msgid ""
"If you navigate to your \"Builds\" page, you will see a ``Failed`` build, "
"which is expected because we've configured Sphinx to fail on warnings and "
"several warnings were encountered during the build."
msgstr ""
"如果你前往\"Builds\"页面，会看到一个``Failed``构建，这是预期结果，因为我们已经将 Sphinx "
"配置为遇警告即失败，而构建过程中遇到了几条警告。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:347
msgid "To learn how to fix these warnings, see the next section."
msgstr "要了解如何修复这些警告，请参阅下一节。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:350
msgid "Installing Python dependencies"
msgstr "安装 Python 依赖"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:352
msgid ""
"The reason :py:mod:`sphinx:sphinx.ext.autosummary` and "
":py:mod:`sphinx:sphinx.ext.autodoc` fail to import the "
":ref:`tutorial/index:making build warnings more visible`, is because the "
"``lumache`` module is not installed."
msgstr ""
":py:mod:`sphinx:sphinx.ext.autosummary` 和 "
":py:mod:`sphinx:sphinx.ext.autodoc` 无法导入:ref:`tutorial/index:making build "
"warnings more visible` 中内容的原因是 ``lumache`` 模块未安装。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:354
msgid ""
"You will need to specify those installation requirements in "
"``.readthedocs.yaml``."
msgstr "你需要在 ``.readthedocs.yaml`` 中指定这些安装依赖。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:356
msgid ""
"To install your project dependencies and make your code available to Sphinx,"
" edit ``.readthedocs.yaml``, add the ``python.install``  section and commit "
"it:"
msgstr ""
"要安装项目依赖并让 Sphinx 能够访问你的代码，请编辑 ``.readthedocs.yaml``，添加 ``python.install`` "
"部分并提交："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:370
msgid ""
"Now, Read the Docs installs the Python code before starting the Sphinx "
"build, which will finish seamlessly. If you go now to the API page of your "
"HTML documentation, you will see the ``lumache`` summary! :tada:"
msgstr ""
"现在，Read the Docs 会在启动 Sphinx 构建之前安装 Python 代码，构建将顺利完成。如果你现在前往 HTML 文档的 API "
"页面，就会看到 ``lumache`` 的摘要！:tada:"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:376
msgid "Enabling PDF and EPUB builds"
msgstr "启用 PDF 和 EPUB 构建"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:378
msgid ""
"Sphinx can build several other formats in addition to HTML, such as PDF and "
"EPUB. You might want to enable these formats for your project so your users "
"can read the documentation offline."
msgstr "Sphinx 除 HTML 之外还能构建多种其他格式，例如 PDF 和 EPUB。你可能希望为项目启用这些格式，以便用户离线阅读文档。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:382
msgid "To do so, add the following ``formats`` to your ``.readthedocs.yaml``:"
msgstr "为此，请在你的 ``.readthedocs.yaml`` 中添加以下 ``formats``："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:396
msgid ""
"After this change, PDF and EPUB downloads will be available both from the "
"\"Downloads\" section of the :term:`project home`, as well as the "
":term:`flyout menu`."
msgstr ""
"完成此更改后，PDF 和 EPUB 下载将同时出现在 :term:`project home` 的\"Downloads\"区域和 "
":term:`flyout menu` 中。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:400
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:404
msgid "Downloads available from the flyout menu"
msgstr "可从浮出菜单下载"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:407
msgid "Versioning documentation"
msgstr "文档版本管理"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:409
msgid ""
"Read the Docs supports having :doc:`several versions of your documentation "
"</versions>`, in the same way that you have several versions of your code. "
"By default, it creates a ``latest`` version that points to the default "
"branch of your version control system (``main`` in the case of this "
"tutorial), and that's why the URLs of your HTML documentation contain the "
"string ``/latest/``."
msgstr ""
"Read the Docs 支持:doc:`为文档创建多个版本 </versions>`，就像你的代码有多个版本一样。默认情况下，它会创建一个 "
"``latest`` 版本，指向版本控制系统的默认分支（本教程中为 ``main``），这就是为什么你的 HTML 文档 URL 中包含字符串 "
"``/latest/``。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:417
msgid "Creating a new version of your documentation"
msgstr "创建文档的新版本"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:419
msgid ""
"Read the Docs automatically creates documentation versions from GitHub "
"branches and tags that :ref:`follows some rules <versions:Versioning "
"workflows>` about looking like version numbers, such as ``1.0``, ``2.0.3`` "
"or ``4.x``."
msgstr ""
"Read the Docs 会根据 GitHub 的分支和标签自动创建文档版本，这些分支和标签需:ref:`遵循一些规则 "
"<versions:Versioning workflows>`，即看起来像版本号，例如 ``1.0``、``2.0.3`` 或 ``4.x``。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:421
msgid ""
"To create version ``1.0`` of your code, and consequently of your "
"documentation:"
msgstr "要创建代码的 ``1.0`` 版本（以及相应的文档版本）："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:423
msgid ""
"Navigate to your GitHub repository, click the branch selector, type "
"``1.0.x``, and click \"Create branch: 1.0.x from 'main'\" (more information "
"`in the GitHub documentation`__)."
msgstr ""
"前往你的 GitHub 仓库，点击分支选择器，输入 ``1.0.x``，然后点击\"Create branch: 1.0.x from "
"'main'\"（更多信息见 `in the GitHub documentation`__）。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:425
msgid ""
"Check that you now have version ``1.0.x`` in your :term:`project home`, "
"click on the :guilabel:`Versions` button, and under \"Active Versions\" you "
"will see two entries:"
msgstr ""
"确认你的 :term:`project home` 中现在有 ``1.0.x`` 版本，点击 :guilabel:`Versions` "
"按钮，在\"Active Versions\"下你将看到两个条目："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:427
msgid "The ``latest`` version, pointing to the ``main`` branch."
msgstr "``latest`` 版本，指向 ``main`` 分支。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:428
msgid "A new ``stable`` version, pointing to the ``origin/1.0.x`` branch."
msgstr "一个新的 ``stable`` 版本，指向 ``origin/1.0.x`` 分支。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:433
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:438
msgid "List of active versions of the project"
msgstr "项目的活跃版本列表"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:440
msgid ""
"When you created your branch, Read the Docs created a new special version "
"called ``stable`` pointing to it. When it's built it will be listed in the "
":term:`flyout menu`."
msgstr ""
"当你创建分支时，Read the Docs 会创建一个名为 ``stable`` 的特殊版本指向它。构建完成后，它将列在 :term:`flyout "
"menu` 中。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:444
msgid "Setting stable as the default"
msgstr "将 stable 设为默认版本"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:446
msgid ""
"To set ``stable`` as the *default version*, rather than ``latest``, so that "
"users see the ``stable`` documentation when they visit the :term:`root URL` "
"of your documentation:"
msgstr ""
"要将 ``stable`` 设为*默认版本*而非 ``latest``，以便用户访问文档的 :term:`root URL` 时看到 "
"``stable`` 文档："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:451
msgid ""
"In the :guilabel:`⚙ Admin` menu of your project home, go to the "
":guilabel:`Settings` link, choose ``stable`` in the \"Default version*\" "
"dropdown, and hit :guilabel:`Save` at the bottom."
msgstr ""
"在项目主页的 :guilabel:`⚙ Admin` 菜单中，前往 :guilabel:`Settings` 链接，在\"Default "
"version*\"下拉框中选择 ``stable``，然后点击底部的 :guilabel:`Save`。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:454
msgid "Modifying versions"
msgstr "修改版本"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:456
msgid ""
"Both ``latest`` and ``stable`` are now *active*, which means that they are "
"visible for users, and new builds can be triggered for them. In addition to "
"these, Read the Docs also created an *inactive* ``1.0.x`` version, which "
"will always point to the ``1.0.x`` branch of your repository."
msgstr ""
"``latest`` 和 ``stable`` 现在都是*活跃的*，这意味着用户可以看到它们，并且可以为它们触发新的构建。除此之外，Read the "
"Docs 还创建了一个*非活跃的* ``1.0.x`` 版本，它始终指向你仓库的 ``1.0.x`` 分支。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:461
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:466
msgid "List of inactive versions of the project"
msgstr "项目的非活跃版本列表"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:468
msgid "To activate the ``1.0.x`` version:"
msgstr "要激活 ``1.0.x`` 版本："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:470
msgid ""
"On your :term:`project home`, go to the \"Versions\", locate ``1.0.x`` under"
" \"Activate a version\", and click the :guilabel:`Activate` button."
msgstr ""
"在你的 :term:`project home` 上，前往\"Versions\"，在\"Activate a version\"下找到 "
"``1.0.x``，然后点击 :guilabel:`Activate` 按钮。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:472
msgid ""
"On the \"Activate\" page with \"Active\" and \"Hidden\" checkboxes, check "
"only \"Active\" and click :guilabel:`Save`."
msgstr ""
"在带有\"Active\"和\"Hidden\"复选框的\"Activate\"页面上，仅勾选\"Active\"，然后点击 "
":guilabel:`Save`。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:476
msgid ""
"Read more about :ref:`hidden versions <versions:Version states>` in our "
"documentation."
msgstr "在我们的文档中了解更多关于:ref:`隐藏版本 <versions:Version states>` 的信息。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:515
msgid "Getting project insights"
msgstr "了解项目数据"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:517
msgid ""
"Once your project is up and running, you will probably want to understand "
"how readers are using your documentation, addressing some common questions "
"like:"
msgstr "项目上线运行后，你可能希望了解读者如何使用你的文档，回答一些常见问题，例如："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:520
msgid "what are the most visited pages?"
msgstr "哪些页面访问量最高？"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:521
msgid "what are the most frequently used search terms?"
msgstr "哪些搜索词最常使用？"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:522
msgid "are readers finding what they are looking for?"
msgstr "读者是否找到了他们想要的内容？"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:524
msgid ""
"Read the Docs has traffic and search analytics tools to help you find "
"answers to these questions."
msgstr "Read the Docs 提供流量和搜索分析工具，帮助你找到这些问题的答案。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:527
msgid "Understanding traffic analytics"
msgstr "了解流量分析"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:529
msgid ""
"The Traffic Analytics view gives you a simple overview of how your readers "
"browse your documentation. It respects visitors' privacy by not storing "
"identifying information about them."
msgstr "流量分析视图为你简要展示读者如何浏览你的文档。它尊重访客隐私，不存储可识别其身份的信息。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:531
msgid ""
"This page shows the most viewed documentation pages of the past 30 days, "
"plus a visualization of the daily views during that period."
msgstr "此页面显示过去 30 天内浏览量最高的文档页面，以及该期间每日浏览量的可视化图表。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:534
msgid ""
"To see the Traffic Analytics view, go back the :term:`project page` again, "
"click the :guilabel:`⚙ Admin` button, and then click the :guilabel:`Traffic "
"Analytics` section. You will see the list of pages in descending order of "
"visits, and a similar visualization to this one:"
msgstr ""
"要查看流量分析视图，请再次返回 :term:`project page`，点击 :guilabel:`⚙ Admin` 按钮，然后点击 "
":guilabel:`Traffic Analytics` 区域。你将看到按访问量降序排列的页面列表，以及类似下图的图表："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:540
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:545
msgid "Traffic Analytics plot"
msgstr "流量分析图表"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:547
msgid ""
"You can also download this data in :abbr:`CSV (Comma-Separated Values)`  "
"format for closer inspection. To do that, scroll to the bottom of the page "
"and click the :guilabel:`Download all data` button."
msgstr ""
"你还可以下载 :abbr:`CSV（逗号分隔值）` 格式的数据以便详细查看。为此，请滚动到页面底部并点击 :guilabel:`Download all"
" data` 按钮。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:552
msgid "Understanding search analytics"
msgstr "了解搜索分析"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:554
msgid ""
"As well as traffic analytics, Read the Docs shows :doc:`what terms your "
"readers are searching for </search-analytics>`. This can inform decisions on"
" what areas to focus on, or what parts of your project are less understood "
"or more difficult to find."
msgstr ""
"除了流量分析，Read the Docs 还会显示:doc:`读者正在搜索哪些词 </search-"
"analytics>`。这可以帮助你决定应重点关注哪些领域，或项目中哪些部分较难理解或难以找到。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:558
msgid ""
"To generate some artificial search statistics on the project, go to the HTML"
" documentation, locate the Sphinx search box on the left, type "
"``ingredients``, and press the :kbd:`Enter` key. You will be redirected to "
"the search results page, which will show two entries."
msgstr ""
"要在项目中生成一些模拟搜索统计数据，请前往 HTML 文档，找到左侧的 Sphinx 搜索框，输入 ``ingredients``，然后按 "
":kbd:`Enter` 键。你将被重定向到搜索结果页面，其中显示两个条目。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:563
msgid ""
"Next, go back to the :guilabel:`⚙ Admin` section of your project page, and "
"then click the :guilabel:`Search Analytics` section. You will see a table "
"with the most searched queries (including the ``ingredients`` one you just "
"typed), how many results did each query return, and how many times it was "
"searched. Below the queries table, you will also see a visualization of the "
"daily number of search queries during the past 30 days."
msgstr ""
"接下来，返回项目页面的 :guilabel:`⚙ Admin` 区域，然后点击 :guilabel:`Search Analytics` "
"区域。你将看到一个表格，其中列出搜索次数最多的查询（包括你刚输入的 "
"``ingredients``）、每个查询返回的结果数以及被搜索的次数。在查询表格下方，你还将看到过去 30 天每日搜索查询次数的可视化图表。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:571
#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:576
msgid "Most searched terms"
msgstr "搜索次数最多的词"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:578
msgid ""
"Like the Traffic Analytics, you can also download the whole dataset in CSV "
"format by clicking on the :guilabel:`Download all data` button."
msgstr "与流量分析一样，你也可以通过点击 :guilabel:`Download all data` 按钮以 CSV 格式下载完整数据集。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:582
msgid "Where to go from here"
msgstr "下一步"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:584
msgid "This is the end of the tutorial. You have accomplished a lot:"
msgstr "本教程到此结束。你已经完成了很多工作："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:586
msgid "Forked a GitHub repository."
msgstr "Fork 了一个 GitHub 仓库。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:587
msgid "Connected it to Read the Docs."
msgstr "将其连接到 Read the Docs。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:588
msgid "Built its HTML documentation."
msgstr "构建了它的 HTML 文档。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:589
msgid "Customized the build process."
msgstr "定制了构建过程。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:590
msgid "Added new documentation versions."
msgstr "添加了新的文档版本。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:591
msgid "Browsed the project analytics."
msgstr "查看了项目数据分析。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:593
msgid "Nice work!"
msgstr "做得很好！"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:595
msgid ""
"Here are some resources to help you continue learning about documentation "
"and Read the Docs:"
msgstr "以下是一些资源，帮助你继续学习文档编写和 Read the Docs："

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:598
msgid "Learn more about the platform :doc:`features </reference/features>`."
msgstr "进一步了解平台的:doc:`功能 </reference/features>`。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:599
msgid ""
"Learn about other supported documentation generators in the :doc:`Sphinx "
"tutorial <sphinx:tutorial/index>` or the `MkDocs User Guide "
"<https://www.mkdocs.org/user-guide/>`_."
msgstr ""
"在:doc:`Sphinx 教程 <sphinx:tutorial/index>` 或 `MkDocs User Guide "
"<https://www.mkdocs.org/user-guide/>`_ 中了解其他受支持的文档生成器。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:600
msgid "See a list of Read the Docs :doc:`/examples`."
msgstr "查看 Read the Docs :doc:`示例 </examples>` 列表。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:601
msgid "Learn how to do specific tasks in the :doc:`/guides/index`."
msgstr "在 :doc:`/guides/index` 中了解如何完成特定任务。"

#: ../../upstream/docs/user/tutorial/index.rst:602
